    "html": "\n  <div class=\"hero-meta\">\n    <span class=\"level-badge\" data-level=\"3\">Level 3 - Intermediate</span><span class=\"time\">25 min</span>\n    <span class=\"chip warn\">Medium</span><span class=\"chip accent\">Prefix product</span><span class=\"chip accent\">Two passes</span>\n    <a class=\"chip\" href=\"https://leetcode.com/problems/product-of-array-except-self/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">LC 238</a>\n  </div>\n  <h1>Product of Array Except Self</h1>\n  <p class=\"lead\">Everything except index i = (everything left of i) × (everything right of i). Write the left products into the output on one pass, multiply the right products in on a backward pass with a single running variable. No division, so zeros need no special case. O(n) time, O(1) extra space.</p>\n"
